#### 5. Eager Test
**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)

Calls **7 distinct production methods** (`ValidateOrder`, `CalculateTotal`, `ApplyDiscount`, `ReserveInventory`, `ProcessPayment`, `SendConfirmation`, `UpdateOrderHistory`). When this test fails, diagnosing which method broke requires stepping through all of them.

