**Fix:** Use named constants that document the derivation:

```csharp
const decimal expectedSubtotal = 3 * 59.99m + 1 * 67.53m; // SKU-1 × 3 + SKU-2 × 1
const decimal taxRate = 0.09m;
const decimal expectedTax = Math.Round(expectedSubtotal * taxRate, 2);
const decimal expectedGrand = expectedSubtotal + expectedTax;

